Tab Statistics
Statistics is described under the Tab Statistics.
To view Resource Statistics of Stationary Resources in the Statistics Report, select View > Show
Statistics Report in the dialog of the object. You can also click the right mouse button in the Frame and
select Show Statistics Report or you can press F6.
